Grammar

    0 $accept: Program $end

    1 Program: BlockBody

    2 Expressions: Expressions COMMA Expression
    3            | Expression

    4 NonAttributedExpression: Block
    5                        | Call
    6                        | Function
    7                        | Type
    8                        | MatchExpression
    9                        | RuntimeExpression
   10                        | WrappedExpressions
   11                        | Literal

   12 WrappedExpressions: LPAREN Expressions RPAREN

   13 Expression: Block
   14           | Call
   15           | Function
   16           | Type
   17           | MatchExpression
   18           | RuntimeExpression
   19           | WrappedExpressions
   20           | AttributedExpression
   21           | Literal

   22 Block: LBRACE BlockBody RBRACE

   23 BlockBody: Statements Expressions
   24          | Expressions

   25 MatchExpression: MATCH LPAREN Expression RPAREN LBRACE MatchCases RBRACE

   26 MatchCases: MatchCases MatchCase
   27           | MatchCase

   28 MatchCase: CASE Expression COLON Expressions SEMI

   29 Function: FUNCTION LPAREN FunctionParametersOptional RPAREN FunctionAttributesOptional FunctionBody PERCENT

   30 FunctionParametersOptional: FunctionParameters
   31                           | ε

   32 FunctionParameters: FunctionParameters COMMA FunctionParameter
   33                   | FunctionParameter

   34 FunctionParameter: AccessAttribute IDENTIFIER TypeAttribute

   35 FunctionAttributesOptional: FunctionAttributes
   36                           | ε

   37 FunctionAttributes: FunctionAttributes FunctionAttribute
   38                   | FunctionAttribute

   39 FunctionAttribute: FunctionExternalAttribute
   40                  | FunctionInternalAttribute

   41 FunctionExternalAttribute: EXTERNAL LPAREN Expressions RPAREN

   42 FunctionInternalAttribute: INTERNAL LPAREN Expressions RPAREN

   43 FunctionBody: COLON Expressions
   44             | ε

   45 Call: NonAttributedExpression LPAREN Expressions RPAREN
   46     | NonAttributedExpression LPAREN RPAREN

   47 RuntimeExpression: RUNTIME LPAREN Expression RPAREN

   48 Literal: STRING
   49        | INTEGER
   50        | FLOAT
   51        | CHAR
   52        | Identifier
   53        | MACRO
   54        | NIL

   55 Identifier: Identifier DOT IDENTIFIER
   56           | IDENTIFIER

   57 Type: TYPE LPAREN Expression RPAREN LBRACE TypeEntries RBRACE

   58 Statements: Statements Statement
   59           | Statement

   60 Statement: CallStatement
   61          | AssignmentStatement
   62          | ContinueStatement
   63          | BreakStatement
   64          | LabelStatement

   65 CallStatement: Call SEMI

   66 AssignmentStatement: AssignmentTarget EQ Expressions SEMI

   67 AssignmentTarget: AccessAttribute IDENTIFIER TypeAttribute
   68                 | Identifier
   69                 | UNDERSCORE

   70 ContinueStatement: CONTINUE IDENTIFIER Expressions SEMI

   71 BreakStatement: BREAK IDENTIFIER Expressions SEMI

   72 LabelStatement: IDENTIFIER COLON MatchExpression SEMI
   73               | IDENTIFIER COLON SEMI

   74 TypeAttributeOptional: TypeAttribute
   75                      | ε

   76 TypeAttribute: COLON Expression

   77 TypeEntries: TypeEntries TypeEntry
   78            | TypeEntry

   79 TypeEntry: IDENTIFIER TypeAttributeOptional SEMI

   80 AccessAttribute: IN
   81                | OUT
   82                | INOUT

   83 PointerAttribute: PTR
   84                 | REF

   85 AttributedExpression: AccessAttribute Expression
   86                     | PointerAttribute AttributedExpression


